<!--
license:CC0-1.0
copyright-holders:superctr

The JV-1080 front panel.  The display is a negative 40 x 2 character module; the
twenty-four lamps are led<8 * column + row> of the key matrix, so the tone keys, the
PALETTE / PARAMETER pair, the part-range key and the mode and sound blocks light.
Coordinates are tenths of a millimetre on the 482 x 88.1 mm plate.
-->
